650.00" width="480.00" height="120.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n51" value="Optional IAM policy and existing KMS key references remain separately supplied.&lt;br&gt;No application logger, PII processor, policy enforcement code or token metric emitter is created." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=15;fontColor=#312D2A;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="n4"><mxGeometry x="50.00" y="820.00" width="2300.00" height="65.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n52" value="DEFAULT RESULT: No resources. Creation flags false; alarms={} and policy_statements=[].&lt;br&gt;Creating a log group does not wire a producer or automatically set connector_source_log_group_id; the source ID is an explicit prerequisite.&lt;br&gt;Object Storage targets can use the created bucket/namespace or explicit overrides. Streaming is an alternative, not a second simultaneous sink.&lt;br&gt;The Cloud Guard recipe is a configurable placeholder, not an implemented PII/GenAI detector. No redaction, safety filtering, token metering or notification delivery was tested." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FCFBFA;strokeColor=#9E9892;fontColor=#312D2A;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.00" y="1150.00" width="2460.00" height="135.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n53" value="Source review: 2026-10-28. No cloud provisioning, provider revalidation, compliance certification, packet test or recovery drill.&lt;br&gt;Placement values are source defaults or marked operator inputs. Arrows are configuration relationships / stated route intent, not verified runtime behavior." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#312D2A;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mx